The billing document layout in this directory (documentParts.tsx), and the receipt and
invoice sheets built on it (../receiptDocument.tsx, ../invoiceDocument.tsx), are adapted
from Invoicely (https://github.com/legions-developer/invoicely, commit
820d3c51604faa10d44126e019c1fad51b54d96f): apps/web/src/components/pdf/default.tsx and
apps/web/src/components/pdf/vercel.tsx. Only the design was adapted; no code was copied
verbatim and none of its dependencies is used.

